  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Browser (RUM)\nWhat the **user** experienced, as opposed to what the server did.\n\n- Vitals are reported **once per page view**, not continuously \u2014 expect sparse lines on a low-traffic app. Shown at **p75**, the percentile Google defines its thresholds against.\n- Broken down by **route template**, never URL. If you see a concrete path here (`/orders/42`), that app is minting one metric series per URL and needs fixing before it fills the shared metric store.\n- Dashed line marks Google's *good* threshold: LCP 2.5s, INP 200ms, CLS 0.1.\n- **No data?** The browser half fails silently \u2014 a blocked CORS preflight, an ad blocker, or an app posting to the service OTLP port instead of the browser one all look identical from here: nothing arrives."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LCP p75 \u2014 loading",
      "description": "Largest Contentful Paint: when the main content became visible. Good < 2.5s.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
